{"meetingId": "809", "tickets": [
{"title": "Process $38,000 IRA withdrawal for remodel deposit", "text": "Process a $38,000 gross one-time distribution from Dorian Pebblefizz's traditional IRA at Velvet Acorn Custody to Teacup Comet Bank checking for the first contractor deposit on the home accessibility remodel (first-floor bathroom and entryway changes).", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-08-15", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Dorian asked for a $38,000 gross distribution from the traditional IRA at Velvet Acorn Custody to be sent to Teacup Comet Bank checking for the first contractor deposit on the accessibility remodel. They agreed to process that withdrawal, with the follow-up dated 2025-08-15."},
{"title": "Change recurring payment instructions", "text": "Confirm the requested recurring payment change for Dorian Pebblefizz, raising the traditional IRA distribution at Velvet Acorn Custody from $4,000 gross per month to $6,500 gross per month into Teacup Comet Bank checking, and document the revised bank destination and withholding assumptions before the next payment cycle.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": "2025-08-20", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": "edf2fbce-5c49-5e58-9961-8db31aa328b7", "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Dorian asked to raise the regular IRA cash flow from $4,000 gross per month to $6,500 gross per month and to document the revised bank destination and withholding assumptions before the next payment cycle. They agreed to make and document that adjustment, with the follow-up dated 2025-08-20."},
{"title": "Complete address and residency update workflow", "text": "Use this workflow when a client reports a new mailing address, tax residency change, seasonal residence, or household relocation. Confirm the effective date, update advisory records, and identify planning consequences for tax-aware investment management, retirement income distributions, and account communications. Dorian Pebblefizz and Elena Pebblefizz moved from Portland, Oregon, to Henderson, Nevada, in June 2025, and the Henderson home is now the primary residence; advisory records, mailing information, meeting location notes, and retirement distribution withholding assumptions need updating with the new residency facts Dorian provided.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": "2025-08-22", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": "24021c5e-be89-5d42-9140-abb9dc028eee", "subTasks": [{"title": "Confirm move details and documentation", "text": "Collect the new mailing address, physical residence, prior address, effective date, seasonal residence notes, and any supporting documentation the client is comfortable providing.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": null, "dueDate": null}, {"title": "Update internal records and communication preferences", "text": "Update CRM, household profile, statement delivery preferences, meeting location notes, and any compliance-required address fields.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": null, "dueDate": null}, {"title": "Review planning impacts", "text": "Check whether the move affects state tax assumptions, retirement distribution withholding, municipal bond exposure, estate document jurisdiction, insurance coverage, or advisor registration requirements.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": null, "dueDate": null}, {"title": "Confirm completion with client", "text": "Send a brief confirmation summarizing the updates made and any follow-up items the client should address with tax, legal, or account providers.", "priority": "low", "assigneeId": null, "dueDate": null}], "evidence": "the household’s move from Oregon to Nevada requires advisory records, mailing information, meeting location notes, and retirement distribution withholding assumptions to be updated using the new residency facts Dorian provided. They agreed to complete those updates, with the follow-up dated 2025-08-22."},
{"title": "Resolve Oregon withholding discrepancy on IRA payments", "text": "Correct the custodian record at Velvet Acorn Custody that still shows Oregon state withholding on Dorian Pebblefizz's recurring IRA distribution, since the Henderson, Nevada home is the current primary residence and Oregon withholding is not expected on future payments.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-08-29", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "the custodian record still shows Oregon state withholding on the recurring IRA distribution even though Dorian described the Henderson home as the current primary residence and did not expect Oregon withholding on future payments. They agreed to address that discrepancy, with the follow-up dated 2025-08-29."},
{"title": "Check IRA payment timing and bank instruction history", "text": "Review the payment timing and bank instruction history for Dorian Pebblefizz's recurring IRA ACH deposits from Velvet Acorn Custody into Teacup Comet Bank checking, after a recent deposit arrived late and required a manual transfer from savings to cover household bills.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-08-18", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Dorian reported that a recent IRA ACH deposit reached Teacup Comet Bank later than expected and caused him to move money manually from savings to cover household bills. They agreed that the payment timing and bank instruction history need to be checked, with the follow-up dated 2025-08-18."},
{"title": "Year-End Deadline Sweep", "text": "Complete a year-end cash flow and withholding review for Dorian Pebblefizz and Elena Pebblefizz with their CPA, Tobin Mossbutton of Amber Teapot Tax Services, before final estimated tax planning. Inputs include the household's higher IRA withdrawals (raised to $6,500 gross per month), possible Portland sale proceeds of about $410,000, and Elena's expected 2025 wages of about $28,000.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-11-14", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": "098a99bb-56c3-5bae-8a8a-0daaeba9311f", "subTasks": [], "evidence": "the household’s higher IRA withdrawals, possible Portland sale proceeds, and Elena’s wages were identified as inputs for a year-end cash flow and withholding review with the CPA before final estimated tax planning. They agreed to that review, with the follow-up dated 2025-11-14."},
{"title": "Request and organize estate document copies", "text": "Ask the client to provide current copies of core estate documents, including will, revocable trust if applicable, powers of attorney, health care directives, beneficiary designations, trustee or executor contact information, and any recent amendment pages. Store received documents according to firm procedures and note missing items for follow-up. Dorian Pebblefizz only has 2018 wills and powers of attorney on file, so current wills, powers of attorney, trust amendment pages if applicable, and beneficiary confirmations need to be collected for recordkeeping and planning review.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": "2025-09-05", "assigneeId": "a76627e3-5ef0-5551-a608-b225e494e4cf", "templateId": "0abfb48a-c041-5167-89d9-5c914aeb4eb5", "subTasks": [], "evidence": "current wills, powers of attorney, trust amendment pages if applicable, and beneficiary confirmations need to be collected for recordkeeping and planning review. They agreed to collect those materials, with the follow-up dated 2025-09-05."},
{"title": "Review cash-raising plan for concentrated employer stock", "text": "Compare IRA distributions, taxable cash, and selective sales for Dorian Pebblefizz's cash-raising plan without assuming the Paper Otter Components stock is the first funding source, given the large Paper Otter Components position of about $92,000 in the joint taxable account at Velvet Acorn Custody and Dorian's preference to review tax impact and concentration risk together before selling.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-09-12", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "the cash-raising plan should compare IRA distributions, taxable cash, and selective sales without assuming the employer stock is the first funding source. They agreed to that cash-raising review, with the follow-up dated 2025-09-12."}
]}
